{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "288ce062-4537-8056-a39e-d985a4e514be",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T17:45:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:42:43-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello Kevin. I know it's quarter to six, City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number. Am I on a speaker? I've got you on the speaker, I hope you can hear me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My street hasn't been plowed. Not once since the storm. Sunday into Monday, the snow and then the rain, whatever that was. It's Tuesday night now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mill Street. 468 Mill Street, up on the Hill. I'm the landlord, I've got tenants who have to get cars out of there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "468 Mill. Got it. And when you say not plowed, is it completely untouched, or did somebody come through and just miss part of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Untouched. Well, it's slush turned to ice now, with ruts in it. The avenue's clear. The boulevard's clear. I drove down Memorial Boulevard this afternoon, which, by the way, is where I learned to parallel park, nineteen sixty-something, and it was bare pavement. And I come back up here and it's a skating rink."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:43:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Yeah, the main roads get done first, and then the side streets and the narrow ones on the Hill come after. Let me write this down. Mill Street, 468, no plow since Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since before Monday. Sunday it started. I want to know when it's getting cleared. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:18-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I don't have the route sheet in front of me tonight, so I can't point to a particular hour. I'll put it in as a request for the morning crew and flag that it's ice-packed now. Realistically, I'd say sometime tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Okay. Because it's been two days, Kevin. Two days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Is it the whole length of Mill, or just your block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just around my block as far as I can see. I didn't walk the whole thing, I'm seventy-some years old, I'm not walking Mill Street in this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll note your block. Do you want a call back when it's been done, or just leave it as a request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just leave the request. Well, put my number down in case. It's 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-eight-eight, got it. Nelson, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nelson Raposo. R-A-P-O-S-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Nelson Raposo, 468 Mill Street, unplowed since the weekend storm, ice-packed, request in for tomorrow morning. That's all in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Thank you. I'll look for the plow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Stay off those steps if they're icy, and have a good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T17:45:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep. Good night."
    }
  ],
